---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import ResourceActions from '../components/ResourceActions.astro';
import {Image} from 'astro:assets';
import family from '../assets/about-family-continuity-20261001.png';
import {phone,url} from '../data/site';
const path='/seva';
const faqs=[
 {question:'What is Pinnacle SEVA?',answer:'SEVA means Social Equity in Valuable Access. It is Pinnacle Blooms Network’s programme for helping families explore developmental therapy support when cost is a barrier. Published programme materials describe a subsidised-access model centred on dignity.'},
 {question:'Is free or subsidised therapy available to my family now?',answer:'Call 9100 181 181 to ask about current support. The team must confirm eligibility, documents, participating locations, any fees and appointment availability for your situation. Reading this page or making an enquiry does not confirm a subsidy or a place.'},
 {question:'Does SEVA replace assessment or my child’s therapy plan?',answer:'No. SEVA concerns access to support. The professional assessment and child-specific plan determine suitable goals, therapies, everyday practice and review. Financial-support eligibility and clinical decisions are separate.'}
];
const sources=[url('/global-research-whitebook'),url('/verify/evidence/research-library.html'),url('/verify/evidence/organisation-profile.html')];
const ask=['What support is currently available for our situation?','Which centre and professional would be suitable?','What eligibility information or documents are required?','What would we pay, for which services, and for how long?','How will we review the plan and any support arrangement?'];
---
<PageLayout path={path} label="SEVA · Access to support" title="Pinnacle SEVA | Developmental Therapy Access & Family Support" description="Understand Pinnacle SEVA—Social Equity in Valuable Access. Ask about current developmental therapy support, eligibility and a suitable centre on 9100 181 181." documentOnly includeService={false} publishedOn="2026-10-04" updatedOn="2026-10-04" shareImage={family} shareFit="contain" imageAlt="Pinnacle family journey: understand together, choose meaningful goals, practise in daily life and review the next step" imageCaption="Pinnacle SEVA · Dignity, access and a clear next conversation" citations={sources} faqs={faqs}>
 <article class="seva-page">
  <section class="wrap seva-hero" aria-labelledby="seva-title">
   <div><p class="eyebrow">Pinnacle SEVA™ · Social Equity in Valuable Access</p>
    <h1 id="seva-title">When cost is a barrier, <em>start with a conversation.</em></h1>
    <p class="seva-lead">You want your child to communicate, take part and grow toward a self-sufficient, mainstream-included life. If paying for developmental support feels difficult, speak with us about the options currently available for your family.</p>
    <p><strong>SEVA is our programme for helping families explore access to developmental therapy support.</strong> Our published programme materials describe a subsidised-access model with dignity at its centre.</p>
    <div class="seva-actions"><a class="button primary" href={phone.href} data-cta="hero-call"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 3h4l2 5-3 2a15 15 0 0 0 6 6l2-3 5 2v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2C10 20 4 14 3 5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2Z"/></svg>Call {phone.display}</a><a class="button outline" href="#your-conversation">What to ask →</a></div>
    <p class="seva-small">Ask the team to confirm present eligibility, any fees and the right centre before travelling. An enquiry does not confirm a subsidy or appointment.</p>
   </div>
   <figure><Image src={family} width={760} widths={[380,760,1100]} sizes="(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 48vw" format="webp" quality={85} alt="Illustrative Pinnacle family journey: a family and professional understand the child, choose goals, practise together and review progress." loading="eager" fetchpriority="high"/><figcaption>Your child’s life gives the work its direction.</figcaption></figure>
  </section>
  <section class="wrap seva-purpose" aria-labelledby="seva-purpose-title"><p class="eyebrow">Access with dignity</p><h2 id="seva-purpose-title">A financial question deserves a respectful answer.</h2><p>SEVA stands for <strong>Social Equity in Valuable Access</strong>. Its purpose is to help reduce financial barriers to developmental therapy. We want families to be able to discuss support without losing sight of the child’s capabilities, choices and everyday life.</p><p>Our <a href="/global-research-whitebook">2025 Global Research Whitebook, section 5</a>, describes this access model. Current arrangements need an individual conversation; earlier published criteria are not an automatic entitlement today.</p></section>
  <section class="wrap seva-next" id="your-conversation" aria-labelledby="seva-next-title"><p class="eyebrow">Make the first step useful</p><h2 id="seva-next-title">Three things to clarify together.</h2><ol class="seva-steps"><li><span aria-hidden="true">01</span><h3>Your family’s priorities</h3><p>Tell us what matters in your child’s day—asking for help, getting dressed, playing or joining in at school—and what makes access difficult.</p></li><li><span aria-hidden="true">02</span><h3>The support available</h3><p>Ask about current eligibility, documents, participating centres, costs and appointment availability. Get a clear answer before deciding or travelling.</p></li><li><span aria-hidden="true">03</span><h3>The next step you choose</h3><p>Discuss a suitable professional conversation and how the plan will be reviewed. Keep the agreed services, fees and support terms clear.</p></li></ol>
   <div class="seva-checklist"><div><h3>Keep these questions beside you when you call.</h3><ul>{ask.map(q=><li>{q}</li>)}</ul></div><div><p>You can organise observations privately with our free one-page planning sheet.</p><a class="button outline" href="/books/resources/first-conversation">Prepare your first conversation →</a><p class="seva-small">The sheet is optional. You do not need to upload personal or financial documents to read this page.</p></div></div>
  </section>
  <section class="wrap seva-life" aria-labelledby="seva-life-title"><div><p class="eyebrow">The purpose stays your child’s life</p><h2 id="seva-life-title">Access opens the door. A meaningful plan gives the work direction.</h2><p>Once the next step is agreed, the child’s self-sufficient, mainstream-included life remains the purpose. That purpose shapes what to understand, the goals, the people and methods involved, practice at home and school, and what to review.</p><p>For example, being able to ask for help at home or in class may bring communication support, everyday practice and family or teacher observations together. The right contributions depend on your child; SEVA is an access programme, not a separate clinical treatment or a fixed therapy package.</p><a class="button outline" href="/pinnacleai">Explore how PinnacleAI connects the journey →</a></div><div class="seva-related"><h3>Understand the support</h3><a href="/autism-therapy">Integrated autism support <span>→</span></a><a href="/top-speech-therapy-center-india-proven-improvement-rate">Speech & communication <span>→</span></a><a href="/best-occupational-therapy-center-india-proven-improvement-rate">Occupational therapy & daily life <span>→</span></a><a href="/best-aba-therapy-center-india-proven-improvement-rate">ABA & behavioural support <span>→</span></a><a href="/best-special-education-center-call-9100181181">Special education & learning <span>→</span></a><a href="/centers">Find a Pinnacle centre <span>→</span></a></div></section>
  <section class="wrap seva-faq" aria-labelledby="seva-faq-title"><p class="eyebrow">Clear answers</p><h2 id="seva-faq-title">Before you call</h2>{faqs.map(f=><details><summary>{f.question}</summary><p>{f.answer}</p></details>)}</section>
  <section class="wrap seva-evidence" id="sources" aria-labelledby="seva-evidence-title"><p class="eyebrow">Read. Check. Share.</p><h2 id="seva-evidence-title">The programme and its evidence.</h2><p>Read the <a href="/global-research-whitebook">SEVA definition in the 2025 Whitebook</a> alongside the <a href="/verify/evidence/research-library.html">Verify research catalogue</a>, which distinguishes company-published summaries from independently reviewed research. This page does not use those summaries to promise a child’s result.</p><p>Pinnacle Blooms Network is operated by <strong>Bharath Healthcare Laboratories Private Limited</strong>. <a href="/verify/evidence/organisation-profile.html">Check our organisation identity and sources →</a></p><ResourceActions/><p class="seva-small">Page reviewed 4 October 2026. Cite: Pinnacle Blooms Network, “Pinnacle SEVA: developmental therapy access and family support”. <a href="/seva.md">Plain-text reading version</a>.</p></section>
  <section class="wrap seva-call" aria-labelledby="seva-call-title"><h2 id="seva-call-title">Let’s understand what is possible for your family.</h2><p>Start with your questions. We’ll help you understand the next conversation to have.</p><a class="button primary" href={phone.href} data-cta="final-call">Call {phone.display}</a><p><a href="/national-autism-helpline">Pinnacle helpline details →</a></p></section>
 </article>
</PageLayout>
<style>
.seva-page{color:#20375d;background:#fff}.seva-page p,.seva-page li{line-height:1.8}.seva-page h2{font-size:clamp(1.55rem,2.6vw,2.3rem);line-height:1.3;max-width:31ch}.seva-page h3{font-size:1.14rem;line-height:1.5}.seva-page a:not(.button){text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.2em}.seva-hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.05fr 1fr;gap:2.4rem;align-items:center;padding-block:3rem}.seva-hero h1{font-size:clamp(2rem,3.7vw,3.6rem);line-height:1.13;margin:1rem 0;max-width:21ch}.seva-hero h1 em{color:#9b287e;font-style:normal}.seva-lead{font-size:1.12rem}.seva-hero figure{margin:0}.seva-hero img{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:22px}.seva-hero figcaption{font-weight:700;text-align:center;margin-top:.8rem;color:#7d257e}.seva-actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.8rem;margin-top:1.4rem}.seva-actions svg{width:22px;height:22px;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.8}.seva-small{font-size:.92rem;color:#43556e}.seva-purpose{border-left:5px solid #0d9ca4;background:#f4fbfb;padding:1.5rem 2rem;margin-block:1.5rem 3rem;border-radius:0 20px 20px 0}.seva-next,.seva-life,.seva-faq,.seva-evidence{padding-block:2.5rem;border-top:1px solid #e0e6eb}.seva-steps{list-style:none;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));padding:0;gap:2rem;margin-block:2rem}.seva-steps li{border-top:3px solid #bd248b;padding-top:1rem}.seva-steps span{font-size:2rem;font-weight:700;color:#008b91}.seva-checklist,.seva-life{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.3fr 1fr;gap:3rem;align-items:center}.seva-checklist{padding:1.5rem 2rem;background:#faf7fd;border-radius:20px}.seva-checklist ul{padding-left:1.25rem}.seva-checklist li{margin:.5rem 0}.seva-related{border:1px solid #d9e7e8;border-radius:20px;padding:1.5rem}.seva-related a{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:.75rem;padding:1rem 0;border-top:1px solid #dce9ea;font-weight:700}.seva-faq details{border-bottom:1px solid #dedde5;padding:1.2rem 0}.seva-faq summary{font-weight:700;font-size:1.06rem;cursor:pointer;line-height:1.6}.seva-evidence{max-width:900px}.seva-call{background:#f8f3fb;text-align:center;padding:2.5rem;border-radius:24px;margin-block:1.5rem 3rem}.seva-call h2{margin-inline:auto}.seva-page .button{min-height:48px}.seva-page :focus-visible{outline:3px solid #008b91;outline-offset:4px}@media(max-width:800px){.seva-hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding-block:2rem;gap:1.5rem}.seva-hero figure{max-width:650px;margin:auto}.seva-steps{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:1rem}.seva-steps li{display:grid;grid-template-columns:3rem 1fr;gap:0 1rem}.seva-steps h3{margin:.2rem 0}.seva-steps p{grid-column:2;margin-top:.2rem}.seva-checklist,.seva-life{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:1.3rem}.seva-purpose,.seva-checklist,.seva-call{padding:1.3rem}.seva-purpose{width:calc(100% - 2rem)}.seva-next,.seva-life,.seva-faq,.seva-evidence{padding-block:2rem}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.seva-page *{scroll-behavior:auto}}
</style>
